&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="6-ocidocker-基础">6. OCI/Docker 基础&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>如果题目要求处理镜像归档或 Dockerfile，记住最短路径：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">9
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">cat &amp;gt; Dockerfile &lt;span class="s">&amp;lt;&amp;lt;&amp;#39;EOF&amp;#39;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s">FROM nginx:alpine
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s">COPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s">EXPOSE 80
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="s">EOF&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker build -t ckad-nginx:latest .
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker save ckad-nginx:latest -o /tmp/ckad-nginx.tar
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker load -i /tmp/ckad-nginx.tar
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>OCI 归档类题：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker pull nginx:latest
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker save nginx:latest -o /tmp/nginx-image.tar
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">mkdir -p /root/oci-images
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">tar -xf /tmp/nginx-image.tar -C /root/oci-images
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="考场压缩记忆">考场压缩记忆&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>排障先证据后修改：&lt;code>get -&amp;gt; describe -&amp;gt; logs -&amp;gt; events&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Deployment 修复后必须 &lt;code>rollout status&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Service 题核心看 &lt;code>endpoints&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Helm 固定顺序：&lt;code>repo add/update -&amp;gt; install -&amp;gt; list/status -&amp;gt; upgrade/rollback&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>CRD 固定骨架：&lt;code>group + names + versions + schema&lt;/code>。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item></channel></rss>